WEBVTT

00:03:58.734 --> 00:04:02.825
was when we felt the effects of increased
hateful racist and Islamophobic rhetoric

00:04:02.849 --> 00:04:04.460
reaching closer to home.

00:04:05.628 --> 00:04:08.357
My wife and I tried
to shield our kids from the news,

00:04:08.381 --> 00:04:11.609
but like noxious tear gas
ready all around us,

00:04:11.633 --> 00:04:13.479
the ugly reality was closing in,

00:04:13.503 --> 00:04:15.723
and our kids were choking
on the fear and hate.

00:04:16.905 --> 00:04:19.399
My 12-year-old son routinely
came home panicked

00:04:19.423 --> 00:04:21.369
that his dad was going to be killed

00:04:21.393 --> 00:04:23.486
and that our family
was going to be deported

00:04:23.510 --> 00:04:24.925
or put in internment camps.

00:04:25.499 --> 00:04:27.399
He thought being identified as a Muslim

00:04:27.423 --> 00:04:28.620
was a bad thing.